    "expect": { "pt": { "Joraga Treespeaker": [1, 1] }, "counters": { "Joraga Treespeaker": { "Level": 0 } }, "players": [ { "battlefield_has": ["Joraga Treespeaker"] }, {} ] } },
  { "name": "ruling: a copy of a leveler copies its printed abilities but not its level counters (copy is level 0, 1/1)",
    "players": [ { "hand": ["Clone", "Terror"], "battlefield": ["Island", "Island", "Island", "Island", "Swamp", "Swamp"] }, { "battlefield": [ { "name": "Joraga Treespeaker", "counters": { "Level": 5 } } ] } ],
